# Auth — can .env REDIS_URL + user-service :8083
# Docs: docs/AUTH_SERVICE.md, docs/ENV_AND_REDIS.md
# Chay Login truoc de gan @token (http-client.env.json)
@auth = {{auth}}
@username = {{username}}
@password = {{password}}

### Login (lấy JWT)
# @name login
POST {{auth}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{username}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

###
# Gán token cho các file khác (chạy block Login trước)
@token = {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### Actuator health (cần rebuild auth-service sau khi thêm dependency)
GET {{auth}}/actuator/health

### Register
POST {{auth}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "new_user_http",
  "password": "Pass123!",
  "email": "new_user_http@test.com",
  "name": "New HTTP User"
}

### Refresh (refreshToken luu tren Redis — can REDIS_* trong .env)
POST {{auth}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### Logout (xoa refresh token khoi Redis)
POST {{auth}}/api/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}
